 to delivery partners ahead of standard delivery orders to save time. Enjoy it on eligible orders for less with your Grubhub+ membership. \n\n If your order arrives late, we'll refund you the Priority Delivery fee.","c.d.i.t64":"What's Priority Delivery?","c.d.p.l71":"Priority","c.d.r.l88":"Robot","c.d.r.p.b65":"If a robot isn't available, your order will fall back to standard delivery. Tip applies.","c.d.r.p.b95":"Got it","c.d.r.p.t118":"Limited availability","c.d.s.l90":"Standard","c.d68":"Your order settings","c.d.i.c85":"What's Drone Delivery?","c.d.i.h.d88":"Head to the designated drop zone","c.d.i.h.l106":"If a drone is available, we'll assign it to you after checkout.","c.d.i.h.p102":"We’ll send a person if a drone isn’t available","c.d.i.h.t69":"Get your tip refunded","c.d.i.h.t112":"How it works","c.d.i.h.w119":"Wait for drone to place your order down and fly away before safely approaching","c.d.i.l81":"Enjoy reliable delivery, with a touch of the future. Our delivery drones will zip to your home and touch down with your order—no need to tip.","c.d.i.t75":"What is drone delivery?","c.d.o.b73":"Give drone delivery a try, and we’ll send one of our automated little friends to drop off your order.","c.d.o.b.o119":"Yes, I’m open to drone delivery","c.d.o.b.o127":"No, send a person instead","c.d.o.d86":"Retrieve order from the designated drop zone","c.d.o.p104":"We’ll send a person if a drone isn’t available","c.d.o.t75":"Get your tip refunded","c.d.o.t126":"Want to save on tip?","c.d.o.w126":"Keep all people, pets, and objects at least 20 ft away from the delivery point","c.e.h.t72":"Edit delivery address","c.e.h.t101":"Edit contact information","c.e104":"Edit drop-off pin","c.e.a.d111":"Unfortunately, we noticed some unusual activity on your account. Check your email for more information and contact support if you think this is a mistake.\n\nYour cart and payments have been removed. To place an order, start a new cart, and add a new payment method at checkout.\